          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Buzz had waited so long his wings felt sleepy.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nutty waited politely behind him on the garden path.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "This is a remarkably slow queue today.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yes. I wonder when the person in front will begin.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Buzz had seen Nutty standing beside a little basket.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "He thought a new garden game was about to open.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "I shall stand here ready for my first turn.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "I can wait behind you while you get ready.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Buzz moved one step nearer the basket.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nutty followed and stood a little way behind.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "The queue has moved. We must be almost open.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is encouraging. I was beginning to wonder.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Buzz cleared his tiny throat very politely.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nutty looked toward the empty basket without moving.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Perhaps the game keeper has not seen us waiting.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "Perhaps the game keeper needs a little more time.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "question",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "calm",
          "holdSec": 3,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": {
            "answer": {
              "text": "Ask each other!",
              "emoji": "💡"
            },
            "praise": "You thought about our friends!"
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "How could they learn what the queue is for?",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Buzz moved to the other side of the basket.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nutty followed him around its curved wooden handle.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "This new entrance might be the official queue.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "It has a fine view of the old entrance.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "They stood beside the basket for another quiet moment.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "One leaf drifted between their very patient feet.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Does a game normally take this long to begin?",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "Not when the game keeper knows we are here.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Buzz turned to let Nutty take the front place.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nutty looked surprised at this very generous offer.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "You can go first. I do not mind waiting.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "Thank you. What exactly is my first turn?",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Buzz pointed toward the completely empty garden basket.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nutty peered at it from his new front position.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Whatever your game is. I am ready to play.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "My game? I thought this was your game.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Buzz blinked at Nutty and then at the basket.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Both friends finally understood their extremely patient queue.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "I was waiting for you to start something!",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "And I was waiting for you to do the same!",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "surprised",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "question",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "calm",
          "holdSec": 3,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": {
            "answer": {
              "text": "Yes!",
              "emoji": "💡"
            },
            "praise": "You thought about our friends!"
          },
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Can they start a new game together?",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "They laughed beside the basket that contained no game.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Buzz picked up the leaf from their empty entrance.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "We could invent something now we have arrived.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "That would make excellent use of being first in line.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Buzz made a leaf-toss target inside the basket.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nutty agreed to one little turn for each friend.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "One toss, then swap. No mysterious game keeper.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "And nobody has to wait for an invisible opening time.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "They took turns aiming the leaf at the broad basket.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "A gentle breeze made their tosses curve sideways.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Our game has a very wiggly flight path.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "At least the queue is finally going somewhere.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "After several turns, Buzz offered to rest on the bench.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nutty joined him with their little basket between them.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Welcome to the official queue for a comfortable sit.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "text": "Excellent. I believe we have both reached the front.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "story",
          "background": "garden",
          "character": "bee",
          "secondCharacter": "squirrel",
          "energy": "upbeat",
          "holdSec": 1,
          "prop": "🧺",
          "question": null,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "A loose leaf drifted past the resting friends.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Buzz watched it travel right along their old queue.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "He announced that the next customer was arriving early.",
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "emotion": "neutral",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "Perhaps the leaf will know which game it wants.",
              "speaker": "friend",
              "emotion": "happy",
              "action": "nod"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
